# Proposal for a new research-only repository. Not applied to the original repo.
# Allowlist: start by ignoring all files, then explicitly allow reviewed types.
*
!*/
!*.py
!*.sh
!*.md
!*.txt
!*.toml
!*.yaml
!*.yml
!*.json
!*.csv
!.gitignore
!LICENSE

# Exclusions always take priority over the extension allowlist.
**/.git/
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/env/
**/.venv/
**/venv/
**/__pycache__/
**/cache/
**/data/
**/datasets/
**/rgb*/
**/depth/
**/mask*/
**/labels/
**/poses*/
**/checkpoints/
**/weights/
**/runs/*/checkpoints/
**/watcher_backups/
**/scene_gt*.json
**/scene_camera*.json
**/*credential*
**/*secret*
**/*token*
**/*password*
**/*.pem
**/*.key

# This is defense in depth: use an explicit reviewed file manifest as well.
